This event celebrates 20 million downloads of Battle Cats starting from September 1st, 2015 to September 17th, 2015.

==Event==
*'''Campaign 1: 20 MILLION DOWNLOADS Event Stages'''
:・[[Joy of 20 Million!|20 Million Downloads Special Gift!]] - ''"Oodles and oodles of spectacular gifts, including Normal and Rare Tickets!"''
:・[[Deadly Carnival!|20 Million Downloads Deadly Carnivals!]] - ''"The baddest of the bad are here again! Dare you challenge these Hard++ stages? Master these levels to get Rare" Ticket rewards!''
*'''Campaign 2: [[:Category:Monthly Event All-Stars Stages|Monthly All-Star Stages!]]'''
All of the [[:Category:Event Enemies#Month Events Enemies|toughest baddies]] from the [[Special Events|Monthly Stages]] have banded together to take down the [[Cat Units|Cats]] in these special Hard+++ stages!
Claim mountains of XP by conquering these super-tough stages with style!
Clear the stages again for a set chance to get more XP!
:・[[Special Thanks! (Insane)|Monthly Event All-Star Special Anniversary!]]: Sept. 1st - 17th (until 11:00)
:・[[Ultra Stress! (Insane)|Monthly Event All-Star Ultra Anniversary!]]: Sept. 5th - 17th (until 11:00)
:・[[Miracle Tactics! (Insane)|Monthly Event All-Star Miracle Anniversary!]]: Sept. 9th - 17th (until 11:00)
:・[[Wonderful Conquest (Insane)|Monthly Event All-Star Celebration!]]: Sept. 13th - 17th (until 11:00)
*'''Campaign 3: [[Rare Capsule Bonus Characters|Limited-Edition Units Available Rare Capsules!]]'''
''"Featuring the limited-edition units'' [[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Gold Cat]], [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]], ''and'' [[Cat Base Mini (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Base Mini]].

''Plus, the brand-new Super Rare character'' [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]]!

''Don't miss this chance to add these cool Cats to your collection!"''
*'''Campaign 4: Bonus gifts'''
Visit The Battle Cats anytime during this event to get one free [[Cat Capsule|Rare Ticket]]!

Get a variety of cool items as bonus gifts by logging in each day!

:・9/1 - 9/4: 30 [[Cat Food]] each day!
:・9/5 - 9/8: 1 [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]] each day!
:・9/9 - 9/12: 1 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] each day!
:・9/13 - 9/17: 1 [[Battle Items#Speed Up|Speed Up]] each day!

